     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Note to myself: Look into passing in the console information into the agents via aws \"user data\" if that can be used by the script that may be a way around having to embed the console id into the agent amis.  The goal is to be able to share the AMIs (not have them be dependent on any one EC2 user account).",
          "type": "text"
