      "timeZone": "America/New_York"
     },
     "body": "<p>Checked in at <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-packer-aws-grinder\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-packer-aws-grinder</a></p>\n\n<p>It seems the init.d script of the agents still needs a looped check for the console's IP because the console is sometimes slow in getting it's public IP address.</p>",
     "created": "02/Dec/14 11:57 AM",
     "id": "12656",
     "jsdPublic": true,
